<!-- @after 14. Further Reading :: recap -->
### Say these in the interview

- **Every interactive element gets a meaningful label;** merge a row's children so TalkBack reads it once.
- **Touch targets are at least 48 dp;** text uses sp and still fits at 200% font scale.
- **Contrast meets WCAG AA:** 4.5:1 for body text, 3:1 for large text, icons and UI components.
- **Respect "Remove animations"** and caption all media.
- **Automate, then still test by hand:** accessibility checks in CI (Compose 1.8.0+), plus a manual TalkBack pass on every screen.
